  "limits": "One unpaced local release-mode run, single host thread, uncontrolled OS/desktop scheduling. Per module: fill N beings with one small state-building op each (64-op workflows, requests pre-parsed and excluded), then 1,000 single-op queries spread over the cast (JSON parse excluded, output Value construction included). state_bytes counts live heap growth during the fill via a counting allocator (minimal per-being state; richer beings use more). Excludes JSON parsing/serialization, the gamectx local CLI, cross-module wiring, model calls and engine work; not a whole-game or realtime guarantee."
